<title>POLAND: BANK GDANSKI FEB NET FALLS TO PLN 5.2 MLN.</title>
<headline>BANK GDANSKI FEB NET FALLS TO PLN 5.2 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results February </p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>FEBRUARY</p>
<p> Net profit					  5.20 vs   10.66</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit				   10.36 vs   19.33</p>
<p> Profit on banking operations		 34.84 vs   35.52</p>
<p> Interest and other related revenues	67.01 vs   58.56</p>
<p>JANUARY-FEBRUARY</p>
<p> Net profit					 15.63 vs   23.84</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit				   26.54 vs   42.27</p>
<p> Profit on banking operations		 69.75 vs   66.33</p>
<p> Interest and other related revenues     133.86 vs  116.96</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish bank is Bank Gdanski SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
